  "text": "Ulmworth Works\n\nBarley Soup Recipe:\n1. Rinse 1 cup of pearl barley.\n2. In a large pot, sauté 1 diced onion, 2 chopped carrots, and 2 chopped celery stalks in butter or oil until soft.\n3. Add 4 cups of vegetable or chicken broth and 1 cup of barley.\n4. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 45-60 minutes until barley is tender.\n5. Season with salt, pepper, and fresh herbs like thyme or parsley.\n\nTULOVO-LOVOSO"
